LB02_DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","name":"_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.glueSample._proof_1","type":"∀ {N k K b : ℕ} {cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K} (r : RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription N k K b)\n  (hr : Function.Injective r.row) (e : Fin (N - b) → Fin N) (he : Function.Injective e)\n  (hc : ∀ (i : Fin N), (∃ (q : Fin (N - b)), e q = i) ↔ ¬∃ (q : Fin b), r.row q = i)\n  (residual : TimeProfile.Cuts k (N - b) K),\n  (∀ (j : Fin K) (a : Fin k), RiffleLowerV2.usedCount r j a + residual.count j a = cuts.count j a) →\n    ∀ (η : RiffleLowerV2.Sample residual) (j : Fin K) (a : Fin k),\n      {i : Fin N | RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.rawGlue✝ r hr e he hc (TimeProfile.sampleRow η) i j = a}.card = cuts.count j a","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription","Function.Injective","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.row","HSub.hSub","instHSub","instSubNat","Iff","Exists","Eq","Not","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","instAddNat","RiffleLowerV2.usedCount","TimeProfile.Cuts.count","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","Finset.card","Finset.filter","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.rawGlue","TimeProfile.sampleRow","instDecidableEqFin","Finset.univ","Fin.fintype"],"value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription","Function.Injective","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.row","HSub.hSub","instHSub","instSubNat","Iff","Exists","Eq","Not","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","instAddNat","RiffleLowerV2.usedCount","TimeProfile.Cuts.count","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","Eq.mpr","Finset.card","Finset.filter","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.rawGlue","TimeProfile.sampleRow","instDecidableEqFin","Finset.univ","Fin.fintype","id","congrArg","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.count_split","List.Vector.get","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.word","congrFun'","congr","Finset","Finset.filter_congr","